gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;new name must be unique among siblings; marks this crowd dirty on success&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
