gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;writes the crowd to a new file at path; updates crowd&amp;#x27;s sourceFile; appends path...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeColor=#999999;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
