        <mxCell id="5" value="&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-top:4px;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Crowd Repository&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;+ &amp;lt;&amp;lt; aggregation &amp;gt;&amp;gt; loadedCrowds: List&amp;lt;Crowd&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;+ allCharactersCrowd: AllCharactersCrowd&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:10px;&quot;&gt;+ registerCrowd(crowd: Crowd): void&lt;br/&gt;+ deregisterCrowd(crowd: Crowd): void&lt;br/&gt;+ cloneActiveCrowdFile(sourcePath: Path, clonedPath: Path): void&lt;br/&gt;+ seedFromDefaultCrowdCollection(defaults: DefaultCrowdCollection, crowdTree: CrowdTree): void&lt;br/&gt;+ computeNextAvailableSuffix(basePath: Path): Integer&lt;br/&gt;+ computeClonePath(basePath: Path, suffix: Integer): Path&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr size=&quot;1&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0px;margin-left:4px;font-size:9px;color:#666;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;every loaded top-level crowd has exactly one sourceFile; the same crowd file pat...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;adds crowd to loadedCrowds; rejects if a crowd from the same file path is alread...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;removes crowd from loadedCrowds when the GM deactivates its file&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;clonedPath is &amp;quot;&amp;lt;name&amp;gt; (N).json&amp;quot; in the same directory; N is the lowest integer ≥...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;only invoked on explicit GM request; never called automatically on startup; popu...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;returns the lowest integer ≥ 2 where no file &amp;quot;&amp;lt;base&amp;gt; (N).json&amp;quot; exists in the sam...&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="verticalAlign=top;align=left;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1">
